{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/\u4e3b\u754c\u976236.gif?t=1742768552\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you ready to wield the power of creation?</strong> In Theurgy City, <i>you</i> are the divine architect. With just a touch, reshape the land and watch as your intelligent citizens build a thriving metropolis around your will.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Divine Command:</strong> No complex menus or micromanaging - your power comes from simple, intuitive spells. Change the terrain, unlock new areas, and guide the growth of your city with every tap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/Weather.gif?t=1742768552\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong> Discover the magic of dynamic building. How will you shape the landscape? Will it be soaring towers reaching for the heavens or sprawling marketplaces teeming with life? Every decision brings a unique vision to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/\u81ea\u52a8\u5efa\u9020.gif?t=1742768552\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer &amp; Expand:</strong> Face challenges head-on, banish those who stand against your city's progress, and claim new territories to expand your dominion. Each victory strengthens your legacy as Theurgy City's ruler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2973250/extras/Kill.gif?t=1742768552\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft your masterpiece. Build your legend.</strong> Download Theurgy City now and unleash the god within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb